full_article:
Nepal President Ramchandra Paudel has congratulated Mirza Fakhrul Islam Alamgir on his election as the 23rd president of Bangladesh.

In a congratulatory message yesterday (21 August), Paudel wished the newly elected Bangladesh president success in carrying out his new responsibilities.

He also reaffirmed Nepal's commitment to further strengthening the longstanding friendly relations between the two countries.

