Paudel stressed the importance of deepening the existing people-to-people ties and expanding mutual contacts between Nepal and Bangladesh.

"Nepal and Bangladesh, bound by historic and people-to-people ties, will continue close cooperation in the future," he said in the message.

googletag.cmd.push(function() { googletag.display("dfp-ad-tbs_rectangle_snd_mobile"); });

The Nepalese president expressed hope that under Mirza Fakhrul Islam Alamgir's leadership, friendly relations between Bangladesh and Nepal would become deeper and broader.

